ed-foreground\",\"children\":\"inheritance\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"tax\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"tax\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"questions\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"questions\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"tax questions\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"tax questions\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"tax faq\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"tax faq\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"2026 tax rules\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"2026 tax rules\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"tax faq 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"tax faq 2026\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-5xl lg:flex lg:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block lg:w-64 lg:shrink-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"official-source\",\"text\":\"Official Source\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"how-much-is-inheritance-tax\",\"text\":\"How Much Is Inheritance Tax?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"states-with-inheritance-tax-2026\",\"text\":\"States with Inheritance Tax (2026)\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-much-is-estate-tax\",\"text\":\"How Much Is Estate Tax?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"state-estate-tax\",\"text\":\"State Estate Tax\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-much-is-the-estate-tax-exemption-in-2026\",\"text\":\"How Much Is the Estate Tax Exemption in 2026?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"how-do-estate-taxes-work\",\"text\":\"How Do Estate Taxes Work?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"is-inheritance-tax-federal\",\"text\":\"Is Inheritance Tax Federal?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"is-real-estate-tax-the-same-as-estate-tax\",\"text\":\"Is Real Estate Tax the Same as Estate Tax?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"can-estate-tax-be-paid-in-installments\",\"text\":\"Can Estate Tax Be Paid in Installments?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"how-is-inheritance-tax-calculated\",\"text\":\"How Is Inheritance Tax Calculated?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"do-i-have-to-pay-taxes-on-money-i-inherit\",\"text\":\"Do I Have to Pay Taxes on Money I Inherit?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"what-is-the-difference-between-estate-tax-and-inheritance-tax\",\"text\":\"What Is the Difference Between Estate Tax and Inheritance Tax?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"related-resources\",\"text\":\"Related Resources\",\"level\":2}]}]}]}],\"$Le\"]}],\"$Lf\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5\"}]}],\"Reviewed: January 2026\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Tax data verified against IRS Publication 15-T & state revenue departments\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":\"Try Our Tax Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"See exactly how much you'll take home after all taxes and deductions.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/paycheck-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Paycheck Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/illinois-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"IL Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/texas-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"TX Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/florida-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"FL Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/self-employment-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Self-Employment\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/relocation-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm